    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"SEARCH is designed to locate an entry in a bibliography file and write that entry to the user's terminal or redirect it to a file.  This version was created to work with a Microsoft Word file, however any ASCII text and other word processing files can be used.  Output will vary depending on how strings are defined in the file.  SEARCH uses one or two search_strings given by the user to locate bibliographic entries.\"",
